'''Billionaire's Bidding''' (億万長者オークション, ''Okuman-chōja ōkushon'', '''Billionaire Auction''') is an event added in the [[Version 15.5 Update]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Billionaire's Bidding will reset when the event ends. The bosses of this Gauntlet are many common enemies that the player encounters during main progress.

==Overview==
Billionaire's Bidding contains a total of 10 stages. After beating 1 stage, the player must wait for the next day before they may proceed to the next one. Rewards for each stage completion are Legendary Banknotes.

